ight:0cm;\r\n	mso-para-margin-bottom:10.0pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-left:0cm;\r\n	line-height:115%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\";\r\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n	mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\n	mso-fareast-language:EN-US;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n\r\n</p><p>Nasdaq has recovered the best out of the broader markets, DJ30 and SP500.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It looks like the tech index is peaking, and MACD showing divergence.\r\nHowever this isnt validated by RSI showing divergence. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>It seems Nasdaq will make a “new high” in the midst of the pandemic.</p>', 'nasdaq-posied-to-make-a-new-high-as-we-come-out-of-lock-down-2020-06-03-5ed7602c743dc.jpg', NULL, '2020-06-03 08:32:44', '2020-06-03 08:32:44');
