 style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\r\nlanguage:x-none;color:black\">·</span><span style=\"width:23.5pt\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">We would not recommend doing any Short Sell trades on gold currently. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none\"><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none\"><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"font-family:Calibri;text-decoration:underline;text-underline:single;\r\nlanguage:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">LONG Case</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;margin-left:28.3464pt;text-indent:\r\n-28.3464pt;mso-level-number-format:bullet;mso-level-text:·;mso-level-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-level-font-family:Symbol;mso-level-indent:28.3464pt\"><span style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\r\nlanguage:x-none;color:black\">·</span><span style=\"width:23.5pt\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">We stand by our last calculations of Gold price reaching the region of $2050—$2100. </span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;margin-left:28.3464pt;text-indent:\r\n-28.3464pt;mso-level-number-format:bullet;mso-level-text:·;mso-level-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-level-font-family:Symbol;mso-level-indent:28.3464pt\"><span style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\r\nlanguage:x-none;color:black\">·</span><span style=\"width:23.5pt\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">Whilst we expect some sort of push back down, we expect this to be another buying opportunity. </span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;margin-left:28.3464pt;text-indent:\r\n-28.3464pt;mso-level-number-format:bullet;mso-level-text:·;mso-level-size:10.0pt;\r\nmso-level-font-family:Symbol;mso-level-indent:28.3464pt\"><span style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;font-family:Symbol;font-size:10.0pt;\r\nlanguage:x-none;color:black\">·</span><span style=\"width:23.5pt\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">We would consider capitulating if Oil breached the last low around $1930. </span><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none\"><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ansi-language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:none\"><span lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"language:en-GB;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 'gold-technical-analysi-xauusd-weekly-update-2023-11-20-655b4c5d3d8b5.png', NULL, '2023-11-20 12:09:01', '2023-11-20 12:09:01'),
